        [
          "text",
          "6. Preconfigure MiniOS"
        ]
      ]
    ],
    [
      "block",
      "paragraph",
      [
        [
          "text",
          "Most MiniOS-specific configuration tools prepare settings for a later boot or a new session rather than changing the running desktop immediately."
        ]
      ]
    ],
    [
      "block",
      "paragraph",
      [
        [
          "text",
